// resources/app.rc - the icon both executables carry.
//
// The file is generated, never drawn by hand: `python tools/make-icon.py --ico 3` rebuilds
// Wallpaper.ico from the same code that renders the candidate sheet, so what Explorer shows, what the
// taskbar shows and what the two tray icons show cannot drift away from the design that was picked.
// Resource id 1 is what Engine/App/Tray.cpp loads with MAKEINTRESOURCEW(1).
1 ICON "Wallpaper.ico"
